      "writtenOn": "2020-10-02T20:14:10Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I assume a local EC image is flashed, Hmir doesn\u0027t match, and soft sync is disabled.\n\nAfter a hard reset, EC stays in RO (because Hmir !\u003d Heff) and the OS boots. When the system shuts down, the G3 hook will trigger a hard reset and EFS2 will fail (again). So, EC will stay in RO. \n\nA RO copy will respect AP_OFF (or no AP_OFF). So, you should get the same behavior as when EFS2 is successful in terms of whether the system stays off or boots after hard resets.",
